#: ../../source/docs/install-firmware.rst:5 eafc9c9bc84b4b5ea935ac8661f77c1c
msgid "Install Firmware"
msgstr "安装固件"

#: ../../source/docs/install-firmware.rst:7 b5de34523b7b4434b290c414a84db18b
msgid ""
"This article explains how to use APM Planner 2 to program your Autopilot "
"with the latest APM firmware."
msgstr "本文介绍如何使用 APM Planner 2 将最新 APM 固件烧录到飞控中。"

#: ../../source/docs/install-firmware.rst:11 7ff603b0920d4b1a8cc8c8e22beca6a1
msgid "1 Connect autopilot."
msgstr "1 连接飞控。"

#: ../../source/docs/install-firmware.rst:13 fc3f77eaddc246e9b007386937ffed43
msgid ""
"Connect the autopilot to your computer with a micro-USB cable. Don't select "
"Connect yet; APM Planner can only load firmware while it displays "
"Disconnected."
msgstr ""
"使用 Micro-USB 数据线将飞控连接至计算机。暂不要选择「Connect」；APM Planner "
"只能在显示「Disconnected」（未连接）状态时加载固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/install-firmware.rst:21 67df5a6b2cbf4a7f9357a9ef3171d06d
msgid ""
"2 Select Initial Setup and Install Firmware. Then select your vehicle type."
msgstr "2 选择「Initial Setup」和「Install Firmware」，然后选择您的飞行器类型。"

#: ../../source/docs/install-firmware.rst:26 f002bff71f8b4e91b691c9519dd268e9
msgid ""
"APM Planner will notify you when the status bar reaches 100% and the "
"firmware installation in complete."
msgstr "当状态栏达到 100% 时，APM Planner 将通知您固件安装已完成。"

#: ../../source/docs/install-firmware.rst:33 6075a15577cb479987dd18f320151659
msgid "3 (Pixhawk) Power cycle and listen for the tone."
msgstr "3（Pixhawk）重新上电并聆听提示音。"

#: ../../source/docs/install-firmware.rst:35 eac7ce3517d14ed3b194c2a974189b83
msgid ""
"After the firmware installation is complete, power cycle your vehicle by "
"disconnecting and reconnecting the USB. Listen for the tone! If you hear a "
"musical tone, your firmware installation is complete. If you hear a tone "
"followed by three beeps, disconnect the USB. Reconnect the USB while holding"
" down the safety button. You will hear several tone sequences followed by "
"two beeps. This indicates your firmware installation is complete."
msgstr ""
"固件安装完成后，断开并重新连接 USB 以对飞行器重新上电。请注意聆听提示音！若听到音乐提示音，说明固件安装完成。若听到提示音后紧跟三声蜂鸣，请断开 "
"USB。按住安全按钮的同时重新插入 USB。您将听到数段提示音序列后跟两声蜂鸣，这表示固件安装完成。"

#: ../../source/docs/install-firmware.rst:44 c140ef48a90c4157b4052ffa15bf28fa
msgid "4 Beta firmware"
msgstr "4 测试版固件"

#: ../../source/docs/install-firmware.rst:46 275b4d93e1b8411b968898638568c752
msgid ""
"If you are an experienced tester looking to download a beta version of "
"developing firmware, select beta to view the available beta firmwares."
msgstr "如果您是希望下载开发中测试版固件的资深测试人员，请选择「beta」查看可用的测试版固件。"

#: ../../source/docs/install-firmware.rst:50 263a34a5130649cf83103f73e38b646d
msgid ""
"You may need to put APM Planner 2.0 in Advanced Mode by selecting File -> "
"Advanced in the menu to show the extra options"
msgstr "您可能需要通过菜单中的「File -> Advanced」将 APM Planner 2.0 切换至高级模式，以显示额外选项。"
